[al:新概念英语第一册]
[ti:105. Full of Mistakes]
[00:01.700]Lesson 105. | 第105课。
[00:03.845]Where's Miss Simpson, Bob? | 辛普森小姐在哪儿，鲍勃？
[00:06.470]I want her. | 我找她。
[00:07.830]Do you want to speak to her, sir? | 您想和她说话吗，先生？
[00:09.940]Yes, I do. | 是的，我找她。
[00:11.605]I want her to come to my office. | 我要她到我的办公室来。
[00:14.465]Tell her to come at once. | 叫她立刻过来。
[00:17.250]Did you want to see me, sir? | 先生，您找我吗？
[00:20.350]Ah, yes, Miss Simpson. | 哦，是的，辛普森小姐。
[00:23.665]How do you spell intelligent? | intelligent 这个词怎么拼写？
[00:27.550]Can you tell me? | 你能告诉我吗？
[00:29.730]I-N-T-E-L-L-I-G-E-N-T. | I-N-T-E-L-L-I-G-E-N-T。
[00:37.745]That's right. | 对了。
[00:39.710]You've typed it with only one L. | 你只打了一个L。
[00:43.675]This letter's full of mistakes. | 这封信错误百出。
[00:46.610]I want you to type it again. | 我要你重打一遍。
[00:49.210]Yes, sir. | 是的，先生。
[00:50.995]I'm sorry about that. | 对不起。
[00:53.385]And here's a little present for you. | 这是送给你的一件小礼物。
[00:56.755]What is it? | 是什么？
[00:58.355]It's a dictionary. | 是一本词典。
[01:00.580]I hope it will help you. | 我希望它能帮助你。